  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Dimgray pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Chromastone_Ultraviolet_Conversion.gif/revision/latest?cb=20260606050906\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Chromastone Ultraviolet Conversion\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Chromastone_Ultraviolet_Conversion.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20260606050906\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Chromastone_Ultraviolet_Conversion.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20260606050906 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a7/Chromastone_Ultraviolet_Conversion.gif/revision/latest?cb=20260606050906 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Chromastone Ultraviolet Conversion\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Chromastone_Ultraviolet_Conversion.gif\" data-image-name=\"Chromastone Ultraviolet Conversion.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Crystalsapiens like Chromastone (Ben 10) can bio-energetically absorb and convert any form of energy, primarily into ultraviolet light.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bio-convert ambient energy</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>bio-absorb and convert ambient energy</b>. Sub-power 